[{"role": "assistant", "content": "To pass data to an Agentforce agent from Embedded Chat v2, you can follow these steps:

1. **Send Context to the Agent via Enhanced Chat**:
   - Use the Data 360 Web SDK anonymous ID to pass context to the chat client.
   - Example code:
     ```javascript
     window.addEventListener("onEmbeddedMessagingReady", () => {
         embeddedservice_bootstrap.prechatAPI.setHiddenPrechatFields({
             "Individual_Id": SalesforceInteractions.getAnonymousId()
         });
     });

     window.addEventListener("onEmbeddedMessagingConversationStarted", (event) => {
         SalesforceInteractions.sendEvent({
             interaction: {
                 name: 'conversation-started',
                 eventType: 'agentEngagement',
                 conversationId: event.detail.conversationId
             }
         });
     });
     ```
   - For details on where to place this code, refer to the documentation.

2. **Helpful Resources**:
   - [Set Up Enhanced Chat for Context Passing](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=mktg.persnl_agentforce_send_context_to_the_agent_via_embedded_service_deployment.htm&type=5&release=260.0.0)
   - [Add Your Embedded Chat to a Website](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=service.snapins_chat_specify_live_agent_settings.htm&type=5&release=260.0.0)
   - [Modernize Agent Conversations with Enhanced Chat v2](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=release-notes.rn_einstein_agent_ecv2_channel.htm&type=5&release=258.0.0)

Would you like more details on any of these steps?"}]

